\"object\"}}, \"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"One verdict per statement presented (claims, summary, action, severity, reporters, resolution,\\nannouncement handling, source agreement and ToT alternatives), plus the sufficiency judgment for the action\\nand for each operational alternative sent. v5: source_consistency (required).\", \"properties\": {\"contract_version\": {\"default\": \"agent3-grounding-judgment-v5\", \"enum\": [\"agent3-grounding-judgment-v5\", \"agent3-grounding-judgment-v4\"], \"type\": \"string\"}, \"verdicts\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/StatementVerdict\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"action_sufficiency\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ActionSufficiency\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null}, \"alternative_sufficiency\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/AlternativeSufficiency\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"source_consistency\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/SourceConsistency\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null}}, \"required\": [\"verdicts\"], \"type\": \"object\"}}\n\nReturn exactly one JSON object for GroundingJudgment matching output_schema. No prose outside the JSON.\n\nThis is the expected criteria for your final answer: One GroundingJudgment JSON object.\nyou MUST return the actual complete content as the final answer, not a summary.\n\nProvide your complete response:"}],"model":"gpt-6.1-sol","max_completion_tokens":16384,"reasoning_effort":"medium","response_format":{"type":"json_object"},"service_tier":"default"}